# Backend routing

Start with `backend/AGENTS.md` and `backend/docs/README.md`.

## Backend-only conventions

For logging, request context, typed config, scheduling, or uptime probes, read
`backend/docs/development/conventions.md` before implementation. In particular:

- use `createAppLogger`, not raw Nest `Logger` instances;
- use typed config, not feature-level `process.env` parsing;
- use Nest scheduling primitives, not raw interval loops;
- keep public website probes owned by the backend uptime module.

## Shared contracts

When a task changes a route, DTO, auth boundary, product rule, or agent
protocol, load the monorepo owners:

- `docs/backend/modules-and-routes.md`
- `docs/backend/contracts/`
- ADRs 0004 and 0005
- `docs/agent/README.md`

Accepted shared contracts override historical notes under `backend/docs/`.
